# A list that contains itself is a value of type [Json] (a checked program
# can build one). Validation assumes a pair of a value and a type it meets a
# second time holds, so the list validates against [Json], and an `is` arm
# for it runs.
[] as [Json] j!
@j @j append drop
@j tryAs [Json] ? len wl
@j match
    is [Json] xs : "the arm runs" wl,
    _ : "no" wl,
end
